Just replace the && with an &.

  oldRecords[compare1 & compare2,]

Note the difference:

  > compare1 <- c(TRUE, FALSE, FALSE)
  > compare2 <- c(TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)
  > compare1 && compare2
  [1] TRUE
  > compare1 & compare2
  [1]  TRUE FALSE FALSE

karl

